{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fd65bb3b-f989-4a0f-b5f8-ba0e8edebe8c",
    "name": "📌 Docker Model Runner API (Localhost)",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Docker is a platform designed to help developers build, share, and run container applications.\"\n\nDocker Model Runner is a Docker Desktop plugin to run LLMs locally. It can be used inside a container or on the host via REST API or CLI. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Run locally**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Docker Account: [https://hub.docker.com/](https://hub.docker.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. docker desktop enable model-runner --tcp 12434\n    \n3. docker model pull ai/gemma3\n    \n4. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/model-runner](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/model-runner)\n    \n- Models: [https://hub.docker.com/u/ai](https://hub.docker.com/u/ai)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2025-04-14T13:31:51.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T23:53:11.000Z",
    "lastUpdatedBy": "7643177",
    "uid": "7643177-fd65bb3b-f989-4a0f-b5f8-ba0e8edebe8c"
